+**Supplement to:** `records/AUDIT-ACT22-ACT21S5-CANDIDATE-REVIEW-2026-10-23.md` (commit `a063170f3b56a6869f492cf4dea84334ec8e5c4a`). The earlier report is preserved unchanged.
