+## Independent test and CI follow-up
+
+The detached candidate remains clean at the specified SHA/tree. Judiciary independently reran:
+
+```sh
+sh tests/run-all.sh
+```
+
+It exited 0 and ended `All Viche tests passed`. The full captured test transcript already retained at `/tmp/opencode/act22-run-all.log` is 283 lines / 14,022 bytes and hashes to `873964769b23b56e745b1b96488606c209f2e2d41f09d9e3cff33f78ca0dd305`; its relevant final lines include passing `predict-smoke`, `suite-compliance-smoke`, `tally-smoke`, and `ballot-integrity`. Fixture diagnostics about absent temporary `delivery-candidates.py`, simulated origin outage, ballot omissions, and resource alerts are expected fixture paths; all corresponding tests pass. Test execution changed no candidate files.
