+| `f215bdba3d202cf470` — AssemblyP1 Slidev | `verified` (source delivery only) | Independent public Git fetch verified sampled branch `3b3b064c7753a3adc1c57f67cf62ee6873a92044`, main `65aa5f0ba73684a19bac86b2249d6101ab96aa4c`, and that the branch is an ancestor of main. Main contains the Slidev project, lockfile, decks, portal, scripts and configuration. The GitHub status API showed pending/zero statuses for the sampled branch head; no Actions run, deployment, or live URL was verified. Thus this verifies source landing, not full CI/deployment acceptance. |
